// Dialog :
"P1268140251" "This becomes stranger. Who could be paying the Outcasts? Why would they want to target us? And what makes poor Henry Meyer so important? We are left with many questions, and the only answers will come by walking into the Outcasts' trap."
// RandomFameString :
"P560089715" "I'm told that the Warshades and the Peacebringers are all the same kind of aliens, but I saw two of them nearly come to blows in the street."

