// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1671669765" "Through your diligent efforts, we are now closer to learning what has become of Shadowcatcher, and who is employing the Outcasts. Unfortunately, the only way to find out is to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>spring the Outcasts' trap, and attempt to rescue Henry Meyers again</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P3536362471" "Spring the Outcasts' trap and attempt to rescue Henry Meyers again"
// SendOffString :
"P2738006639" "It is certain that the Outcasts or whoever are employing them are preparing some vicious surprise to use against you, so I advise you to take care. I do not want you to dissapear like Shadowcatcher has. "
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1854388771" "Spring the Trap"

